  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://chirpneighbors.local/contracts/registered-yard-texture-pack-v2.schema.json",
  "description": "Opt-in private local registered-yard structural boundary. Exact inspected source/export/decoder hashes, owner and development admission, decoded resource budget, legal whole footprints, source/geometry/calibration CAS and actual source-plane correspondence require authoritative runtime validation. Synthetic grammar fixtures grant no rights, support geometry, anatomy, external execution, production approval or public release. Legacy scene and texture-pack versions retain their original bounds."
